      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>This spell functions as @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.2AYPwSy7I0Ar8yAH]{Inflict Pain}, except as noted above.</p>\n<h2>@UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.2AYPwSy7I0Ar8yAH]{Inflict Pain}</h2>\n<p>You telepathically rack the target’s mind and body with agonizing pain that imposes a –2 penalty to ability checks, attack rolls, and skill checks. A target that succeeds at a Will saving throw reduces the duration to 1 round.</p>"
